var CHANNELS_INBOUND_LINE = `INBOUND: when someone messages you on a connected channel, you are woken with a hidden message that opens with the cue ${CHANNEL_INBOUND_WAKE_CUE} and names the source address and sender. That is a real person reaching out on that platform, not the user typing in this app. Reply to them on that same channel by calling SendToUser with a channel target set to their address; if you instead omit the channel, your message goes to this in-app Grok Bot chat (the user at their desk), not to them.`;
var CHANNELS_REACTIONS_LINE = `REACTIONS: the same ${CHANNEL_INBOUND_WAKE_CUE} cue also wakes you when someone reacts to one of your messages (e.g. \u2764\uFE0F). A reaction is a lightweight acknowledgement, not a question: you usually do not need to reply, only act on it if it is useful.`;
